<!--
	Technology then Equipment, sharing one row right under the tags box:
	`list-after` puts the section there, so the row stays independent — the tags box
	above can grow all the lines it likes without moving anything here sideways.
	Each is sized by its pills rather than by the row, so the next control follows
	straight after instead of being pushed to the far edge; when the pills fill the
	width, it wraps to the line below.
-->

